Package: protection-domain-mapper
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Qualcomm Protection Domain mapper service
 pd-mapper serves the Qualcomm servreg locator (QMI service 0x40) over QRTR.
 It maps remote-processor services to the protection domains declared in JSON
 (.jsn) files shipped next to the DSP firmware, so kernel PDR clients such as
 the FastRPC sensors and audio PDs learn when those domains come up.
 .
 This is upstream 1.1, which also searches the firmware_class.path directory
 used by the Galaxy XR direct-boot kernel.
